      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "716907c99fcb802f",
      "translationZh": "Citrini Research 和 TrendForce 最近的供应链模型概述了 ChangXin Memory Technologies（CXMT）的实际晶圆产能扩张情况：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "17058a9c4face06d",
      "translationZh": "基准（2022 年第四季度）：~75k wpm / 每季度 ~225k 片晶圆",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "de87efa0c8c91e6c",
      "translationZh": "合肥 Fab 1 初期产能爬坡（19nm DDR4）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a623a29b717be04f",
      "translationZh": "2x 产出（2024 年第一季度）：~150k wpm / 每季度 ~450k 片晶圆",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bcfd117c36f3bd30",
      "translationZh": "合肥二期扩产（17nm/18nm 工艺节点）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "87a50a8921db9b61",
      "translationZh": "3x 产出（2024 年第四季度）：~200k wpm / 每季度 ~600k 片晶圆",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b18d3d2d84aa9bd8",
      "translationZh": "首批 DDR5 生产线。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5e30b80c226a8bca",
      "translationZh": "4x 产出（2026 年年中）：~300k wpm / 每季度 ~900k 片晶圆",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3d802be1b7e9ed3f",
      "translationZh": "合肥和北京共有三座晶圆厂正在运营。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5fd352393c3890b2",
      "translationZh": "接近 Micron 的水平（2026 年末）：~350k wpm / 每季度 ~1.05M 片晶圆",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a8edbe8e610aad6e",
      "translationZh": "相比之下，Micron 的估计产能为 ~375k wpm（每季度 ~1.12M 片晶圆）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "269eb5c1e06b0ab4",
      "translationZh": "7x 产出（2028 年目标）：~500k wpm / 每季度 ~1.5M 片晶圆",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bfe98104586baffb",
      "translationZh": "随着上海晶圆厂各期项目陆续投产，达到目标产能（约占全球 DRAM 晶圆产能的 ~15%）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "aad282cefa985b36",
      "translationZh": "10x+ 预测（2030 年基准情景）：~750k–800k wpm / 每季度 ~2.25M–2.4M 片晶圆",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b1cf8c09de3c3077",
      "translationZh": "多个晶圆厂综合园区进入成熟运营阶段（乐观模型估计可达 950k wpm）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "693142aa02c59006",
      "translationZh": "数量与密度：CXMT 在晶圆投片总量上正达到一线厂商的水平，但由于制程节点落后（DUV 多重图形化与 EUV 的差别），每片晶圆的比特密度仍然落后。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f8dbf31b0d172605",
      "translationZh": "市场机会：三巨头（Samsung、SK Hynix、Micron）正将洁净室空间重新分配给 HBM 和最先进的服务器 DDR5，从而为 CXMT 的产量进入标准大宗产品应用市场（PC、移动设备、汽车）创造机会。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "26ddf4c07830a7e4",
      "translationZh": "Tom's Hardware / Citrini Research：CXMT 与 Micron 的 DRAM 产能对比",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
